                      <img src="icon_posticon.gif" width="15" height="15" border="0" alt="" title="" hspace="3" /><font color="000000" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica" size="1">Posted&nbsp;-&nbsp;12/01/2004&nbsp;:&nbsp; 23:47:27</font>
                      &nbsp;<a href="pop_profile.asp?mode=display&id=74"><img src="icon_profile.gif" width="15" height="15" border="0" alt="Show Profile" title="Show Profile" align="absmiddle" hspace="6" /></a>
                      &nbsp;<a href="JavaScript:openWindow('pop_messengers.asp?mode=AIM&ID=74')"><img src="icon_aim.gif" width="15" height="15" border="0" alt="Send kizikx an AOL message" title="Send kizikx an AOL message" align="absmiddle" hspace="6" /></a>
                      &nbsp;<a href="post.asp?method=TopicQuote&TOPIC_ID=45&FORUM_ID=7"><img src="icon_reply_topic.gif" width="15" height="15" border="0" alt="Reply with Quote" title="Reply with Quote" align="absmiddle" hspace="6" /></a>
                      <hr noshade size="1"></td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                      <td valign="top" height="100%"><font face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica" size="2" color="000000"><span class="spnMessageText" id="msg"> dont mean to sound picky ... i love the guild family and all but what im looking for in a guild is 60-65+ raiding guild, not nessisarily time/kt but a guild that knows what is going on ... i am tired of getting stuck with a guild (no offense to anyone) that plans a chardok raid for 3 weeks then when they finally go we have no rogue to open the door to the king/queen<br /><br />my characters that i play are:<br /><br />65 monk kizikx 22 aa's <br />63 cleric heelourwounds 9 aa's<br />51 beastlord kizikxx 0 aa's<br /><br />all characters are on different accounts so they are boxable... can contact me here or ingame on any of those 3 toons<br /><br />can box 2 out of 3 at any time getting new computer soon so will be able to 4 box with some old retired toons when that comes in or just 3box with the cleric on solo computer<br /><br />will have magelos up after they fix some gliches they are having</span id="msg"></font></td>
                    </tr>
